  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring Evaluation and Learning - whole programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This service provides monitoring, evaluation and learning support to the programme through a centrally contracted supplier. It helps ensure that programme activities are delivering intended development outcomes, adapting effectively to changing contexts, and representing good value for money.
The service supports the design and use of proportionate approaches to tracking progress, collecting and analysing evidence, and reporting on results across a diverse and complex portfolio. It enables programme teams to assess what is working, identify challenges early, and apply learning to improve delivery and decision-making.
By embedding learning and evidence into programme implementation, this service strengthens accountability, transparency and effectiveness. It supports continuous improvement and helps ensure that development assistance remains relevant, inclusive and aligned with the core objectives of Official Development Assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
